WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
The prerequisite OD-Arc juggle ends at the wall.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.200
Standing medium kick intentionally whiffs during wake-up.

3
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.750
Crouching medium kick hits Ryu during wake-up.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.200
Standing medium punch links directly into the target.

5
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.700
OD Arc Step extends the low conversion.

6
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.700
Sprint launcher continues the juggle.

7
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.250
Light Edge finishes the corner juggle.

8
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.000
Ryu lands after the completed low branch.
